    <!-- Spanish (es). Tú, not usted. Charge / Effort / Rest / HRV / WHOOP / NOOP stay untranslated.
         Correlation and experiment wording keeps its uncertainty: "suele", "puede", "se asocia con",
         never "causa" and never "indica". Strength and direction words are feminine so they agree
         with "correlación" / "conexión" / "relación", the nouns the sentences build around. -->

